      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town was briefly renamed Roy in 1913 after railroad owner Roy Megargel, who promised but failed to build a rail line.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
