      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://encyclopediaofalabama.org/article/frisco-city/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Frisco City’s climate is humid subtropical, with warm temperatures and evenly spread rainfall year‑round.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
